      "dcterms:title": "Extended Bloch group and the Cheeger–Chern–Simons class",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "Neumann, Walter D"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20181026",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We deﬁne an extended Bloch group and show it is naturally isomorphic to H3(PSL(2, C)δ; Z). Using the Rogers dilogarithm function this leads to an ex- act simplicial formula for the universal Cheeger–Chern–Simons class on this homology group. It also leads to an independent proof of the analytic relation- ship between volume and Chern–Simons invariant of hyperbolic 3–manifolds conjectured in [16] and proved in [24], as well as eﬀective formulae for the Chern–Simons invariant of a hyperbolic 3–manifold.",
      "dcterms:source": "library/0307092v2/manifest.jsonld",
      "dcterms:hasVersion": "library/0307092v2"
    }
  ]
